    <desc>Generated by ElkScout (elk-late-rifle-day) from public GIS data (USGS 3DEP, NHD, NLCD, MTBS, BLM SMA, OSM, SNOTEL). Verify land status and current state wildlife agency rules before hunting.</desc>
